  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>❓ 模組介紹 ❓</strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">這個模組為原本缺少這些型態的石頭類方塊增加了<strong>拋光</strong>、<strong>磚塊</strong>、<strong>浮雕</strong>、<strong>柱狀</strong>和<strong>平滑</strong>變種，且大部分方塊現在也擁有半磚、階梯和磚牆等變種。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><strong>⚒ 石頭擴展 ⚒</strong></span></h6><p>&nbsp;</p><h6><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">新增變種的方塊類型包括：<strong>石頭、花崗岩、閃長岩、安山岩、砂岩、紅砂岩、黑石、玄武岩、終界石和深板岩</strong>。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">此外，也為<strong>紅地獄磚</strong>新增了浮雕版本，以及全新的<strong>藍地獄磚</strong>變種。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>⚒ 切割石頭，合成磚塊 <span style=\"font-size:24px\">⚒</span></strong></span></h6><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">新方塊意味著新的合成配方，以及一些舊配方的調整以統一格式。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">拋光：</span></strong>4個原料方塊排列成方形</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'andale mono', monospace\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">磚塊：</span></span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">4個拋光方塊排列成方形</span></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">浮雕：</span></strong>2個拋光半磚上下堆疊</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">柱狀：</span></strong>2個拋光方塊上下堆疊</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>- <span style=\"font-size:18px\">平滑：</span></strong>熔煉原料方塊</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">當然，你也可以使用<strong>切石機</strong>來製作這些方塊。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6><h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>⚒ 其他新增內容 ⚒</strong></span></h6><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">該模組還新增了一個物品：<strong>扭曲疙瘩</strong>。它僅用於合成<strong>藍地獄磚</strong>和<strong>扭曲疙瘩塊</strong>。可以透過將<strong>地獄疙瘩</strong>與<strong>扭曲根</strong>結合來合成。</span></h6>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
